# Build context for demos/downhill/Dockerfile (the repository root): only what the Downhill build reads.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!demos/downhill/**
!demos/help-desk/storefront/**
!deployments/azure/**
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.data
**/.output
**/test
# the storefront's own tests are part of the code Incident Commander reads
!demos/help-desk/storefront/test
!demos/help-desk/storefront/test/**
demos/downhill/docs
demos/downhill/scripts
deployments/azure/hosting
deployments/azure/sandbox
